  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Agrifood Systems Approach for Sudan (SASAS)- Kassala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve livelihoods and food security through strengthening resilience by improving the productivity and profitability of potato farming and marketing systems for inclusive and sustainable agriculture-led economic growth. The proposed interventions under Potato Sector Development for Sudan will contribute to SDG 1 on ending poverty in all its forms and SDG 2 on ending hunger and achieving food security and improved nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
